<p>
To create a new account, log in with one of the identity providers below.
You'll pick your username next.
Your e-mail address comes from your identity provider; it will never be shown to users and will
only be used for optional new-message alerts.
</p>

<% if not Rails.application.open_signups? %>
  <p>
  Invited by <%= link_to @invitation.user.username, user_path(@invitation.user), target: '_blank' %>.
  </p>
<% end %>

<%= render "login/provider_buttons", providers: @providers, verb: "Continue with" %>
